<title>USA: Morgan Stanley Group Inc Q3 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley Group Inc Q3 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary		$1.32		    $1.23</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 1.27		     1.17</p>
<p> Net			219,000		  209,000</p>
<p> Net revs	     1,287,000		1,151,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     154,034		  157,236</p>
<p>	  NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary		$4.79		    $2.41</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 4.59		     2.29</p>
<p> Net			793,000		  422,000</p>
<p> Net revs	     4,264,000		2,955,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     155,305		  155,249</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Quarter ended August 31.</p>
<p>1995 9-mo net after $59 million relocation pre-tax charge.</p>
<p>First Call consensus EPS estimate for quarter was $1.28.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
